==Event Information==
<!--Event Information based on reference, October 15th, 2024.-->
Time to celebrate {{Color|#FF0000|'''10th Anniversary'''}} of The Battle Cats!!<br>
Whether you're a brand new player or have been supporting us since 2014, we thank you for enjoying our game!<br>
We couldn't have made it to 10 years without amazing and loyal players from all over the world!<br>
Lets kick off the real celebration with a spectacular set of special events, capsules and rewards!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On from September 16th, 2024 (11:00AM) until October 28th, 2024 (10:59AM)'''}}

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Grab a huge amount of Cat food for the 10th anniversary with Wildcat Slots!'''}}<br>
Match up all nines to earn a feast of Cat Food!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between October 14th (11:00am) and October 28th (11:59pm)!'''}}

Visit the Cat Base to try out the Wildcat Slots during this {{Color|#0000FF|'''special 10th anniversary event'''}} to earn prizes of at least {{Color|#FF0000|'''1000 Cat Food'''}}!<br>
A huge haul of Cat Food awaits those ready to test their luck at the Wildcat Slots!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Several special offers come together at once!'''}}<br>
Get special perks for playing The Battle Cats for a limited time!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Starting September 16th, 2024 (11:00) get a discount of your first Capsule pull!'''}}<br>
All players get a half-off discount on the Cat Food cost of their first Rare Capsule draw following this 10th Anniversary reset! Your first {{Color|#FF0000|'''Single Draw'''}} (normally 150 Cat Food) will cost only {{Color|#FF0000|'''30 Cat Food!'''}}<br>
And your first {{Color|#FF0000|'''11-Capsule Draw'''}} (normally 1500 Cat Food) will cost you only {{Color|#FF0000|'''750 Cat Food!'''}}

※ If the First Time discount fails to appear, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Half-Off Energy Cost for Empire, Future and Cosmos stages!'''}}<br>
During this event, the Cat Energy cost to challenge stages in the '''Empire of Cats''', {{Color|#34A853|'''Into the Future'''}}, or {{Color|#0000FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} will be half the normal cost each day during the times below!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''7:00am ~ 8:59am / 12:00pm ~ 1:59pm / 7:00pm ~ 8:59pm'''}}

※ This Cat Energy cost reduction does not apply to Zombie Outbreak stages.<br>
※ If the Cat Energy reduction does not appear at the listed times above, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Weekends Only: 50% Off Cat Food Discount on Special Cats'''}}<br>
Purchase Special units for half-off the normal Cat Food cost during the event to get through a tough stage!<br>
Complete your collection by taking advantage of this special offer!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Legend Ticket Sale for the 10th Anniversary!'''}}<br>
Purchase a Legend Ticket for a limited time during the event and collect an Uber Rare or above unit from the special Legend Capsules!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On from September 27th, 2024 (11:00AM) until October 28th, 2024 (10:59AM)'''}}

※ Only one Legend Ticket can be purchased per person during the event.<br>
※If a Legend Ticket cannot be purchased, please update to the latest version of The Battle Cats.<br>
※Legend Capsules do not include seasonal units, collab units, limited units from Girls and Monsters, or limited units from other Rare Capsule sets.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Super Limited Unit: "Gacha Cat" ON SALE!'''}}<br>
Gacha Cat is now part of a special Gacha Cat Set on sale for the 10th anniversary and spinning more than ever! Grab one while you can!

※ The Gacha Cat Set can only be purchased once per user account during the sale period.<br>
※ If you have previously purchased Gacha Cat during a past event, you may not purchase this sale pack again.<br>
※ If the Gacha Cat Sale fails to appear as scheduled, update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●10th Anniversary Special Stages!'''}}<br>
Complete 10th anniversary stages to earn Cat Tickets and XP and other useful items!<br>
During this event, visit the Legend Stages from the Battle Cats title menu and select 10th anniversary stages under the Special Stages section.

※ If 10th anniversary stages do not appear, please update to the latest version of The Battle Cats.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Cybear's Vengeance Returns for the 10th Anniversary!'''}}<br>
Your chance to collect a pile of Cat Tickets! The Deadly challenge "Cybear's Vengeance" is here for a limited time!

Clear the stage when it appears at the time below and you'll pick up a stack of {{Color|#FF0000|'''5 Cat Tickets'''}}!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・September 16th, 2024 (11:00am) thru September 22nd (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・September 23th, 2024 (11:00am) thru September 29th (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・September 30th, 2024 (11:00am) thru October 6th (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・October 7th, 2024 (11:00am) thru October 13th (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・October 14th, 2024 (11:00am) thru October 20th (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・October 21st, 2024 (11:00am) thru October 28th (10:59am)'''}}

{{Color|#34A853|'''The stage can be cleared and rewards collected once during each event period'''}}!<br>
Plus, the very first time you clear this stage, you will collect a bonus reward of {{Color|#00CCFF|'''30 Cat Food'''}}!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Super tough Limited Invasion Stages appear for one big event!'''}}<br>
Can you topple the biggest bosses of the Special Stages?<br>
Check the schedule below to take on one Limited Invasion stages after another!

Invasion Event Phase 1:{{Color|#FF00FF|'''September 30th (11:00am) thru October 7th (10:59am)'''}}<br>
The stages below will appear:<br>
・Invasion Stage: "Clionel Ascendant"<br>
・Invasion Stage: "River Styx"<br>
・Invasion Stage: "King Wahwah's Revenge"<br>
・Invasion Stage: "Deeply Dreaming"<br>
・Continuation Stage: "The Angel & The Demon"<br>
・Continuation Stage: "The King & The Maiden"<br>
・Continuation Stage: "The King & The Angel"

Invasion Event Phase 2:{{Color|#FF00FF|'''October 7th (11:00am) thru October 14th (10:59am)'''}}<br>
The stages below will appear:<br>
・Invasion Stage: "Queen's Coronation"<br>
・Invasion Stage: "Dead on Debut"<br>
・Invasion Stage: "Blue Impact"<br>
・Continuation Stage: "The Queen & The Dead"<br>
・Continuation Stage: "The Dead & The Bloated"<br>
・Continuation Stage: "The Queen & The Maiden"

Can you withstand the gauntlet of giants?! Clear the stages and earn limited Cat Unit rewards!<br>
Plus, get extra rewards by clearing Special Missions, including additional missions that appear as you complete challenges! You can earn mission rewards like Catseyes and Rare Tickets even if you've previously cleared mission stages, so check the Catnip Challenges!

※ As Limited Invasion missions are cleared during this event period, other linked missions will appear with additional rewards available.<br>
※ Invasion Phase 1 Mission Rewards must be claimed at the Catnip Challenges before this event ends on October 7th, 2024 (10:59am). Invasion Phase 2 Mission Rewards must be claimed at the Catnip Challenges before this event ends on October 14th, 2024 (10:59am).<br>
※ Catseyes will be available to use after reaching User Rank 1600.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Monthly All-Star Stages!'''}}<br>
Insane-difficulty Monthly All-Star Stages bring back all of the toughest bosses from the limited-edition Monthly Stages with big XP rewards!

{{Color|#46BDC6|'''・Special Celebration'''}}<br>
On between October 7th (11:00am) and October 10th (23:59pm)!<br>
{{Color|#46BDC6|'''・Ultra Celebration'''}}<br>
On between October 11th (0:00am) and October 14th (10:59am)!<br>
{{Color|#46BDC6|'''・Miracle Celebration'''}}<br>
