{{Color|#46BDC6|'''・Wonderful Celebration'''}}<br>
On between October 18th (0:00am) and October 21st (10:59am)!<br>
{{Color|#46BDC6|'''・Excellent Celebration'''}}<br>
On between October 21st (11:00am) and October 24th (23:59pm)!<br>
{{Color|#46BDC6|'''・Event All-Stars: Grand Jubilee!'''}}<br>
On between October 25th (0:00am) and October 28th (10:59am)!

Clear these stages for a chance to collect tons of XP!<br>
※If this event does not appear, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats and reboot the app.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Catclaw Dojo Challenges'''}}<br>
Get your strongest soldiers of the Cat Army ready, the Dojo Ranking Event is here throughout the 10th Anniversary Campaign and it's time to prove yourself!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On from October 7th, 2024 (11:00AM) until October 28th, 2024 (10:59AM)'''}}

Head to the Catclaw Dojo from the Battle Cats Title Menu and enter the Arena of Honor to join in the challenge! Climb to the highest tiers of power as your scores are measured against all other Battle Cats players? Can you make it to the top 10%?<br>
Try as many times as you like before the event ends, and earn a special prize when your final high score determines your skill tier on October 16th! Tap the Rewards List button to see what you might win as you climb the rankings!<br>
Plus, collect bonus rewards for completing the anniversary dojo mission at the Catnip Challenges!

※ Rewards may take a short time to be delivered after your final ranking tier is determined. Please be patient!<br>
※ Your Ranking Result will be shown in the Catclaw Dojo, but rewards will be claimed by visiting the Mailbox menu from the Battle Cats title screen. It may take a short while after the end of this event before your rewards are delivered. Thank you for your patience!<br>
※ Rewards will expire and become unclaimable 30 days after delivery.<br>
※ Scores achieved during this ranking event will be reset once the next ranking event begins.<br>
※ Accounts flagged for hacking or modding will have their Dojo event scores invalidated and may receive a playing ban.<br>
※ Empire of Cats Ch. 1 must be cleared before the Catclaw Dojo will be available to access.<br>
※ If Dojo events do not appear even if the conditions are met, please ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Special 10th Anniversary Missions Available!'''}}<br>
Complete a special anniversary mission to clear '''Empire of Cats Ch. 1''', then head to the Catnip Challenges Special Missions section to claim your prize of one {{Color|#FF0000|'''Platinum Ticket'''}}, that can be exchanged for a draw of one guaranteed Uber Rare hero at the Rare Capsule machine!<br>
Take on other anniversary event-only Special Missions as well for extra rewards!

※ After completing the mission, you must claim your prize at the Catnip Challenges before October 28th, 2024 (10:59am). If you do not claim your prize before then, you will not be able to earn the reward.<br>
※ Even players {{Color|#FF0000|'''who have already cleared Empire of Cats Ch. 1 can collect this reward!'''}}

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Daily Treasure Festivals!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF9900|'''During this event, get increased Treasure Drop Rates'''}} in Story Mode chapters for a special {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Treasure Festival'''}}, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#34A853|'''even days'''}} visit {{Color|#34A853|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, and on {{Color|#46BDC6|'''odd days'''}} head to {{Color|#46BDC6|'''Into the Future'''}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} on {{Color|#0000FF|'''9/17, 9/20, 9/23, 9/26, 9/29, 10/2, 10/5, 10/8, 10/11, 10/14, 10/17, 10/20, 10/23, 10/26!'''}}

※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Areas'''}}<br>
Only during this event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited areas {{Color|#46BDC6|'''Cats Eye Cave'''}} and {{Color|#46BDC6|'''XP Harvest'''}} for a special set of Cats Eye rewards!<br>
Get as many Cats Eyes as you can and help your units break through to even higher levels!

