==Appears==
===English Version===
*September 16th, 2024 to October 28th, 2024

===Japanese Version===
*November 15th, 2022 to December 27th, 2022

==Trivia==
*Pt. 1: A Decade of Memories shows [[Cats of the Cosmos]] before [[Heavenly Tower]], even though Heavenly Tower was added first. It also shows [[True Form]]s after [[Into the Future]], which is inaccurate unless referring to True Forms of [[:Category:Gacha Cats|gacha units]] such as [[Megidora (Uber Rare Cat)|Megidora]].
*In the English version of Pt. 1: A Decade of Memories, the years 2019 and 2022 are missing.
*Pt. 2: Enemy Maneuvers' stages are named after the years after [[Nyanko Daisensou]]'s release, and mostly include enemies created in those years, explaining the name of the event.
*All of the stage names in Pt. 5: Musical Parade are official titles of [[Music|background music]] used in [[The Battle Cats]], explaining the name of the event.
*All of the stage layouts in Pt. 5: Musical Parade after the first one are direct copies of pre-existing stages.

